      * Interface tests of INVOICE: a file goes in (mocked), a report
      * comes out (captured). RUN executes the whole original flow; the
      * STOP RUN of the program ends the case, not the process.
       TESTSUITE TSTIFACE 'INVOICE through its interface'
       PROGRAM INVOICE

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  T-CAPTURED                PIC X(80).
       01  T-HEADER                  PIC X(80).
       01  T-LINES                   PIC 9(3).
       01  T-AMOUNTS.
           05  T-AMOUNT              PIC 9(7)V99 OCCURS 5 TIMES.

       BEFORE-EACH
           MOVE ZERO TO T-LINES T-AMOUNTS
           MOVE SPACES TO T-CAPTURED T-HEADER
           MOCK CLOCK
               DATE '261106'
           END-MOCK
           MOCK FILE REPORT-FILE
               ON WRITE
                   ADD 1 TO T-LINES
                   IF T-LINES = 1
                       MOVE REPORT-REC TO T-HEADER
                   ELSE
                       MOVE REPORT-REC TO T-CAPTURED
                   END-IF
           END-MOCK
       END-BEFORE

       TESTCASE 'one customer: the record goes in, the line comes out'
           MOCK FILE CUST-FILE
               ON READ
                   EVALUATE CBLT-READ-COUNT
                       WHEN 1 MOVE "C009GAMMA     000123456" TO CUST-REC
                       WHEN OTHER SET CBLT-AT-END TO TRUE
                   END-EVALUATE
           END-MOCK
           RUN
           EXPECT T-LINES TO BE NUMERIC 2
           EXPECT T-HEADER TO BE 'INVOICING   261106'
           EXPECT T-CAPTURED TO BE 'C009 GAMMA          987.64 PREMIUM'
           EXPECT CBLT-STOPPED TO BE TRUE
           VERIFY STOP HAPPENED ONCE
           VERIFY CALL 'DISCOUNT' HAPPENED ONCE
           VERIFY WRITE REPORT-FILE HAPPENED 2 TIMES
           VERIFY READ CUST-FILE HAPPENED 2 TIMES

       TESTCASE 'empty file: only the header'
           MOCK FILE CUST-FILE
               ON READ
                   SET CBLT-AT-END TO TRUE
           END-MOCK
           RUN
           EXPECT T-LINES TO BE NUMERIC 1
           VERIFY CALL 'DISCOUNT' NEVER HAPPENED
           VERIFY STOP HAPPENED ONCE

       TESTCASE 'two customers: DISCOUNT gets each amount in order'
           MOCK FILE CUST-FILE
               ON READ
                   EVALUATE CBLT-READ-COUNT
                       WHEN 1 MOVE "C001ACME      000200000" TO CUST-REC
                       WHEN 2 MOVE "C002BETA      000050000" TO CUST-REC
                       WHEN OTHER SET CBLT-AT-END TO TRUE
                   END-EVALUATE
           END-MOCK
           MOCK CALL 'DISCOUNT'
               MOVE WS-AMOUNT TO T-AMOUNT(CBLT-CALL-COUNT)
               EVALUATE CBLT-CALL-COUNT
                   WHEN 1 MOVE 1600 TO WS-NET
                   WHEN OTHER MOVE 450 TO WS-NET
               END-EVALUATE
               MOVE 'MOCKED' TO WS-CATEGORY
           END-MOCK
           RUN
           EXPECT T-AMOUNT(1) TO BE NUMERIC 2000
           EXPECT T-AMOUNT(2) TO BE NUMERIC 500
           EXPECT T-CAPTURED TO BE 'C002 BETA           450.00 MOCKED'
           EXPECT T-LINES TO BE NUMERIC 3
           VERIFY CALL 'DISCOUNT' HAPPENED 2 TIMES
